{"4006110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Capitaland", "steam_appid": 4006110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start by selling lemonade and rise to become the king of the town. Build businesses, earn reputation, play minigames, buy luxury items, and gain boosts by collecting mushrooms.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start small. Dream big. Get rich.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell lemonade, earn your first cash, and build your way up to become the king of the town. Grow your business empire, unlock new opportunities, and watch your money stack up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capitaland</strong> is a colorful 3D business tycoon where progress is always just one step away. Buy and upgrade properties, complete fun minigames, and earn reputation by helping the city's residents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive fast cars, live in stylish apartments, or test your luck at the casino. Discover hidden property boosts, go fishing for extra rewards, and unlock powerful upgrades to grow even faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play your way</strong> — relax and watch your income grow, or optimize every move to reach the top as quickly as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a lively open world full of secrets, activities, and surprises. From parkour spots to unique locations, there’s always something new to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are countless ways to get rich… what’s yours?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006110/extras/c4c9f77f18c4f4d75e31dd89f889df43.poster.avif?t=1788214313\" aria-label=\"Quick Gameplay\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006110/extras/c4c9f77f18c4f4d75e31dd89f889df43.webm?t=1788214313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006110/extras/c4c9f77f18c4f4d75e31dd89f889df43.mp4?t=1788214313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start by selling lemonade and rise to become the king of the town. Build businesses, earn reputation, play minigames, buy luxury items, and gain boosts by collecting mushrooms.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start small. Dream big. Get rich.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell lemonade, earn your first cash, and build your way up to become the king of the town. Grow your business empire, unlock new opportunities, and watch your money stack up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capitaland</strong> is a colorful 3D business tycoon where progress is always just one step away. Buy and upgrade properties, complete fun minigames, and earn reputation by helping the city's residents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive fast cars, live in stylish apartments, or test your luck at the casino. Discover hidden property boosts, go fishing for extra rewards, and unlock powerful upgrades to grow even faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play your way</strong> — relax and watch your income grow, or optimize every move to reach the top as quickly as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a lively open world full of secrets, activities, and surprises. From parkour spots to unique locations, there’s always something new to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are countless ways to get rich… what’s yours?</str